A||N||4||turbo86se||Officers remarks at checkpoint||||13||
Z||000000||turbo86se||02-15-2000||02:24 PM||||<BR>On my way home from getting lunch this afternoon, (driving my bright yellow 88 coupe) I had the pleasure of getting stopped at a checkpoint set-up by the county police. I'm a criminal justice major at school, so I know the drill. I'm always polite to police, I happily handed him my registration and license, he checked my tag, came back to me and said: "that's a very dangerous car you're driving there, I've been to several accident scenes involving the Fiero, most lead to decapitation or serious injury". I thought to myself, what an a**hole! I just grinned and drove off as he said "drive safe". I've got many friends who are officers or detectives, and none of which have said anything negative about the Fieros safety. Most are surprised when they go to the accident scene to find a mangled Fiero, with the driver and passenger standing there looking at their destroyed prized posession unhurt! ||||reg||13
Z||000001||GT Bastard||02-15-2000||02:43 PM||||Sounds like you handled it the right way.  I would be tempted to call him a damn liar.  <P><BR>...or not||||reg||1
Z||000002||Carolina 88GT||02-15-2000||03:48 PM||||Got pulled a few weeks ago...the only reason..."Well son, I have never seen your car 'round these here parts and it looks like it was goin' kinda fast".  Fortunately, he just gave a warning.  But I was definately sweating it....I could have sworn I heard banjo music as scenes from "Deliverance" flashed.||||reg||6
Z||000003||Monkeyman||02-15-2000||04:13 PM||||Sort of on the same subject---What's now called "Porsche Red" used to be called "Arrest Me Red".  If you go to a Porsche dealer, just ask for it by name.  It's even in their parts book under that name.||||reg||1
Z||000004||DRH||02-15-2000||05:48 PM||||Turbo, <P>Translation: I heard of a guy whose wife's sister knew a guy that responded to an accident where someone in a small car hit an 18 wheeler head on doing over 100 mph and he got messed up pretty bad...<P>||||reg||12
